{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「美容教母」之稱的鄭明明（明明姐）向來在娛樂圈人緣極佳，每年生日均獲大批圈中好友設宴祝賀。日前文雪兒在社交平台公開多張鄭明明生日聚會的合照，只見現場星光熠熠，鄭明明契妹羅霖、謝寧、張文慈、魏秋樺等一眾「美魔女」都盛裝到賀，場面非常熱鬧！</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭明明多年來一直推動美容教育的發展。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2976211/org/e5d42ab3fdf93fcf8233e50ddcd2fd14.jpg/N_JfRYt9IJrD28NIGuF788ZdD6GrW_DLYBWvTmAVr04\"/><figcaption>鄭明明多年來一直推動美容教育的發展。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭明明、羅霖。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3021747/org/25899f4c29bc461068d6c259318279db.jpg/oPXmjBvX-uQsvfC_Is4m2-O_sYN-uhmYyCgsj8goLI8\"/><figcaption>鄭明明、羅霖。</figcaption></figure><p>鄭明明生日翡翠綠刺繡套裝貴氣逼人　羅霖文雪兒齊賀切蛋糕</p><p>文雪兒曬出多張合照，並寫道：「祝我最尊敬的明明姐生日快樂！願您身體健康！主恩常伴！🎂🎂🎂🥰🥰🥰」相中所見，現場以粉紅及銀色氣球佈置，後方掛有「Happy Birthday」銀色流蘇橫額，擺滿各大機構及好友送贈的祝壽花籃與鮮花。鄭明明悉心打扮，身穿一襲翡翠綠色中式刺繡上衣配黑色長褲，胸前別上精緻胸針，其後更披上深綠色奢華皮草披肩，妝容精緻、精神飽滿，盡展雍容華貴氣派。席間眾人齊齊圍在特大雙層紅白色俄羅斯娃娃造型生日蛋糕前，一齊切蛋糕合照，羅霖及文雪兒亦分別緊抱明明姐面貼面獻吻，足見感情深厚。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場非常熱鬧！（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934637001707520576921.jpeg/ycsOABtSBm7TxzQ8WIa166jkN3pMu4lrhxxk3occZN4\"/><figcaption>現場非常熱鬧！（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"齊賀鄭明明生日。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934646045151232185906.jpeg/gjiutb22xJI0NhUSYyQunIrEFz1NycAYzmo2Es5qNhI\"/><figcaption>齊賀鄭明明生日。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"文雪兒。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934646644936704531294.jpeg/38WwdyNlvemJyxZLcqMpvpnsJs4oVBEKWe1h1FntYdQ\"/><figcaption>文雪兒。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅霖。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934644337938432425896.jpeg/QM0gdJVtLoFYyPzmsocpVXy37iv1beT1d4iL0HeIi9A\"/><figcaption>羅霖。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏秋樺。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934641913499648809231.jpeg/6tduBDn40ahxH3Pf0gl79FV267EG-G-TIxnbHyMZ2x8\"/><figcaption>魏秋樺。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝寧。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934639577141248937542.jpeg/Xrc4AVqXxce1b_DgMjDwDETaykwiUt5rtGDS7rRg0u4\"/><figcaption>謝寧。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"熱鬧！（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934643935285248854061.jpeg/AgW5vNfkC_KLCKwEbgXq3Q4eqjkDKOcpEq48txKuPLc\"/><figcaption>熱鬧！（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><p>鄭明明1966年創辦蒙妮坦學院　早年發明紋眉技術進軍內地逾40年</p><p>出身印尼華僑世家的鄭明明，60年代來港發展，最初在美髮店打工，至1966年創立「CMM蒙妮坦學院」，80年代更發明紋眉及紋眼線等美容技術，當年鄭裕玲、關之琳、林鳳嬌及翁虹等紅星均是其座上客，而她與前亞姐冠軍羅霖亦於2014年正式上契結為契姊妹。鄭明明早於80年代已看準內地龐大市場，更北上開設美容分校，進軍內地逾40年建立龐大美容王國，加上多年來投資物業眼光獨到，外界普遍估計其身家早已過億，是圈中出名的富婆！</p><figure><img alt=\"張文慈。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934641695395840830127.jpeg/DQ9o7z1d5vZPdMm7bauw4N4WSo23VivitRSRN7UUkTc\"/><figcaption>張文慈。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貴氣逼人。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934637018484736097653.jpeg/ss758buzqNBcEhScSzNUWiXCiVnAyFgUAWUgIgFlICI\"/><figcaption>貴氣逼人。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人緣極佳。（IG@candymancandy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202934639371620352108376.jpeg/ToVpowGnyCROI42d9JNQ5MzDZUtD5HEYE-bdNRPm3TU\"/><figcaption>人緣極佳。（IG@candymancandy）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.012228+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":903,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:30:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:26.273559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:25.145001+00:00","content_hash":"632c966a5bffc16142769c349d6ada707ab3bd29a57797625e7751df4697724c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}